# --- Top-level data/ corpus (heavy artefacts) -----------------------
# Everything under data/ is ignored: scraped PDFs, parsed markdown,
# JSONL extracts, embedding parquet, HF bundles, viz PNGs, .bak-*
# snapshots. Pull/regenerate via the relevant
# ``packages/datasites/<host>`` pipeline; publish via the matching
# ``packages.datasites.<site>.push_to_hf``. No file under data/ is
# committed.
data/**
